{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-tasks#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-tasks","commit":"ae78a87a3a6349048d6deb23911ec56c713188b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-tasks 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的定时任务插件，在设置页提供任务管理界面，并通过宿主存储和定时调度创建新的 agent 会话。用户可以用 cron 表达式安排提示词按时执行，也能手动立即运行；编辑时可选择工作区和模型，并查看最近运行记录、状态与失败原因。界面支持 cron 快捷选择和未来五次执行时间预览。可选通知设置允许通过宿主中符合投递接口的服务向多个聊天目标发送开始、完成或失败消息，并可设置免打扰时段。安装不要求额外 API Key；通知需另行配置兼容的投递插件和目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:437-459","src/index.js:481-548","src/index.js:873-1008","client/index.js:577-669"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-tasks#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-tasks","commit":"ae78a87a3a6349048d6deb23911ec56c713188b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-tasks lets DSH users schedule prompts as new agent sessions or run them on demand. Its settings page includes cron previews, workspace and model selection, run history, and optional chat notices through host services. Notifications need a delivery plugin; no API key is built in.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:481-548","src/index.js:873-1008","client/index.js:577-669","client/index.js:1016-1149"]}
