{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-tasks#caveat-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-tasks","commit":"ae78a87a3a6349048d6deb23911ec56c713188b4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-tasks 不自带聊天投递服务；通知需要兼容服务及已配置目标。若启用完成结论推送，消息会包含 agent 最终回复的末尾文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:735-790","src/index.js:769-780"]}
